{"product_id":"pod-salt-cherry-ice","title":"POD SALT - Cherry Ice","description":"\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCherry Ice\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: A vibrant blend of sweet cherries and frosty menthol. This e-liquid offers a sweet, tangy cherry flavor upfront, followed by a cool, refreshing menthol finish. It's an invigorating choice for vapers who love fruit flavors with a cool, icy twist, providing a balanced, flavorful, and refreshing vape.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/30mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708783206455,"sku":"POD S - Cherry Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30mg\/ml ( 3% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708783239223,"sku":"POD S - Cherry Ice 30 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708783271991,"sku":"POD S - Cherry Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Pod-salt-cherry-ice-min.jpg?v=1749916826","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-cherry-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




